WEBVTT

00:05:57.895 --> 00:06:01.065
For some, the answer
is a universal basic income,

00:06:01.107 --> 00:06:02.900
a UBI.

00:06:03.609 --> 00:06:06.028
Now, despite being a millennial,

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:09.115
and still petrified
when I look at my bank balance,

00:06:09.156 --> 00:06:10.282
I'm not a fan.

00:06:10.783 --> 00:06:14.495
And the reason is an affordable
UBI is ineffective,

00:06:14.495 --> 00:06:17.456
and an effective UBI is unaffordable.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:21.794
My proposal, instead,
is universal basic services,

00:06:21.794 --> 00:06:22.962
UBS.

00:06:23.421 --> 00:06:25.840
These are services
which are universally available,

00:06:25.881 --> 00:06:27.466
free at the point of consumption

00:06:27.466 --> 00:06:30.719
and paid for through progressive taxation,